    {
        "text": "You haven't seen the innkeep anywhere?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Street Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Weird. He's not at any other of the places, too. Did he finally figure to retire and kick back at home?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Street Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If only.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What's up, Liu, bud? Something got you down?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Street Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_305_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avgnew_npc_140_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I'm totally fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you ask?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inn Assistant"
    },
    {
