    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Your ability's\u2014soil and stone Arts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Precisely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "text": "For all your martial talent, you're a shameful fool to not apply it for good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tying my hands with your sand, cracking my pole\u2014what freak fighting style is that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your pole only lightly splitting against me makes it the strange one here. From whence did it come?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I only use ordinary young bamboo poles.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then my style of engagement must completely lack rigor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's your name?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Taihe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine name. Incredible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's lucky I could do battle with someone like you at the very end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a mandarin, aren't you? Tell me, what are you planning, here, with the goblet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Peace and prosperity in the realm for the ages to come.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahah, that's a grand statement!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "But sadly, I still can't give this to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've got nowhere to run.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014You dare flee?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_302_1#5$1",
        "focus": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "jump",
        "xpos": 60,
        "power": 20,
        "times": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The pole-carrier leaps one step backwards."
    },
    {
        "text": "In ten years scaling the mountains, this is one step among hundreds of thousands."
    },
    {
        "text": "Free as a kite that breaks from its string, he rises as the wind does."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm. A hidden technique?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't catch me in the mountains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Taihe, tell that boy. The Field of Forgotten Water, at the crest of Qujiang Peak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't forget.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "ypos": 200,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
