    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Uncle Taihe...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You couldn't catch him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It would be simple if I chased him with full vigor. But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He's using the goblet as a threat, forcing Innkeeper Zheng to meet with him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In the Field of Forgotten Water at the crest, the two will meet, and one must die.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there no leeway?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I learned its root in our fight just now. There is none whatsoever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The Field of Forgotten Water, was it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to seize the opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#5$1",
        "focus": 0
    },
