    },
    {
        "text": "We're lucky we didn't clash with that pole-carrier any. Seeing his moves reminds me of the last I ever saw Huai Tianpei ten whole years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I assume you recognize those two there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you how my dad's on secret orders from the royal court. Those two are their officials.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know who they are, exactly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The giant lunk in the front's a bigshot from the Department of Discipline and Supervision, that's all I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I see the picture, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not keen on troubling Rhodes Island any... but it looks like we'll need to borrow their power, after all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh* This does put a knot in things, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't hear what they were saying, but judging by the direction they hurried away, they're off to the summit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I'm appointed to meet Rhodes Island at that very summit. Who ever knew the venue'd turn out quite like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So do we ambush them at the summit first?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's not. They're all fine fighters. We'd be asking for trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, what do we do, then\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Wait! Quick, hide in here! Don't poke your head out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
