        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The innkeeper?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's dad doing here...? And...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You look ghastly pale.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is... Is he carrying his blade there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it's been so many years... he's never taken it out... he's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He's a swordfighter, is he?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He used to be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then it seems he's revived the trend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not encouraging.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Du"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_322_lmlee_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_296_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "text": "The closer to the peak, the narrower the road.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "25_g05_mountaincity_d",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nearly there now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Boatman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this the final path?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_294_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The very last one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Boatman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Beyond this village, a small ways west, you'll see a long, long stone stairway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Boatman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Past its top is the Field of Forgotten Water.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Boatman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, there's a fine coincidence, meeting you all here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very much a happenstance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you two after?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The goblet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the summit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no point in hiding it now. Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And someone unaccounted for has it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just what in the world is that cup?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I told you, would you assist us in taking it back, Ms. Kroos?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a lot more to your goals than just 'taking it back.' You obviously want to use it for something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "And my guess is your goal happens to be the same as Mr. Lee's. You're all wanting to find its master.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So why go to all the trouble?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you asking us, Ms. Kroos, or... interrogating us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm no interrogator, here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This goblet was made by the hands of a great offender.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Offender?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The offense wide as the heavens.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Court classified. Don't look into it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you want to use this heaven-wide sinner's work to do something that involves Rhodes Island operators.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "How am I meant to help out if you don't tell me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "My benefactor is quite right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though we may be of different standings, there's never any sense in withholding the details when you entrust affairs to people. The proverb puts it well; another's heart is hard to know. Treat each other with candor to get the matter resolved.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Here I was worried you'd gotten lost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avgnew_455_nothing_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahahah. An informed concern, benefactor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You treat them as your 'operators.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "The youth falls silent."
    },
    {
        "text": "The youngest of the Sui Regulator's Candleholders, he must weigh the pros and cons, and make his choices."
    },
    {
        "text": "It wouldn't be any startling revelation."
    },
    {
        "text": "But he doesn't want any slip-ups made here."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A fearsome beast dwells in this goblet. It's only a portion of his consciousness, of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lord Zuo.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm within my rights. If any ensuing liability falls on the Sui Regulator, you needn't have mercy, Uncle Taihe. Apply the legal proceedings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dwells?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Contemporary feranmutologists are in consensus that, aside from some form of corporealized body, walking in land beyond land, this ancient colossus also has means to dwell within certain objects.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ancient literary saying, 'the beast walks with the generous earth,' actually gives some pointer as to these creatures' characteristics.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, does any old object work?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Weapons are fairly common. Whether it's ancient Sarkaz swords or modern, mass-produced staves, we have precedent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But as for the concrete principle, we're still not sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Same goes for that goblet, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wherever it goes, Waregeists spring up. We can't say we're certain yet, but we have grounds to suspect it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cup is alive, yet it hasn't come to life. The objects around it are all dead, yet live because of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been adrift for a long time. It's by a random chance we were able to determine its location.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So now you're out looking for that offender.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "I said, just now, its maker was guilty. But its present master is someone else entirely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1021_kroos2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And just who is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A poet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "25_g10_lianghouse",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...My Lord.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Ning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The wind is high today. The sun is setting early.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Early, but not so. The time came before I could notice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How long has it been since last you climbed a mountain?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "In antique times, the mountain chains of Shangshu were above human might.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shu's paths try, as climbing atop the heavens.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's different nowadays.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet for what difference tolls, some matters shall remain constant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nowhere in the Three Mounts and Seventeen Peaks may it be found. Will you still search, my Lord?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You would balk at nothing, deceive me, deceive us all for this need?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to find it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "text": "Surely you are aware that e'en justified thousandfold, to impinge is still to impinge, and to contravene is still to contravene?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "text": "Surely you know that should you err once, not only do you forfeit the future, but you bear the brunt of the guilt?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Surely you understand... I am willing to hear what you say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's all the more reason I cannot tell you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Because as I serve as a city magistrate, I account for that single city's safety and life. Be it brick or tile or stove or kitchen, so long as the slightest harm comes to it, it is my failure in duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "As those that tower above me disagree, all I may do... is try my hardest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "When first we met in Shangshu, in my early years, I saw that past your occasional obstinacy, you were principled and upright, of vitality whole. I have been staunch in my trust, that should we work as one, 'twould be no trouble we could not surmount.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet in this moment...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I cannot help but be somewhat disappointed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss Ning"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "These words...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are they words of warning, from my friend, Miss Ning, to me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_298_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_295_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Or a supervisory pressuring, from the Imperial Envoy of Vice-Second Rank, the Assistant Minister of Rites, Ning Ciqiu, upon me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liang Xun"
    },
